his free tool helps you solve that problem. It's what I wish I had when I was in school (especially during college), and so I'm putting it out there for free.</p>","developers":["Soaring Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595440/ba76a4b9b440315a68f080c5fac3939c5fa04d28/header.jpg?t=1760257009","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Catalina 10.15 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5 (Dual-Core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated sound card</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Monterey 12 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple Silicon GPU / equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated sound card</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3595440/1264170470/9204afe2a13a46c68da067a4743ec4cf600d27fb/1750465312/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747954860","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3595440/1264170470/9204afe2a13a46c68da067a4743ec4cf600d27fb/1750465312/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747954860","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3595440/1264170470/9204afe2a13a46c68da067a4743ec4cf600d27fb/1750465312/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=17479